[statement]
A removal waits for the packages needing it: `lib`, listed first, goes
after `a`, which needs it; `x`, which waits for nothing, goes first.

[repository]
P:b
V:1

[installed]
P:lib
V:1

P:x
V:1

P:a
V:1
D:lib

[request]
b

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
remove x 1
remove a 1
remove lib 1
install b 1
